      "finding": "The records assert the absence of a comparably diverse, high-resolution, ethically sourced AI-ready dataset. The sources describe an infrastructure need and a goal to develop a highly diverse resource; that ambition does not establish that no comparable dataset exists. The unqualified negative claim was not flagged in the audit and remains after reconciliation.",
